{"ID":"20240504170622-dguuiaa","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504170622-dguuiaa","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504170622-dguuiaa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624095846-auljwyw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611124638-wrabyi2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1600,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611124802-epw4czf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:14,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:14\u0026#125;","title":"154理石","type":"doc","updated":"20240813140256"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240624095846-auljwyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624095846-auljwyw","updated":"20240813135827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"纤维石膏2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/纤维石膏2-20240624095846-4oz5v73.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813135938-a31w4tl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813135938-a31w4tl","updated":"20240813135946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 471px;","style":"width: 461px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"理石"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/理石-20240813135938-9az2wl0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 461px;\" parent-style=\"width: 471px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 275px;","style":"width: 265px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"纤维石膏"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/纤维石膏-20240624095736-4yc0jcp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 265px;\" parent-style=\"width: 275px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813140122-ht6x9c9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813140122-ht6x9c9","updated":"20240813140256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 749px;","style":"width: 739px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"理石 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/理石 1-20240813140122-w3k4jfy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 739px;\" parent-style=\"width: 749px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624100133-be7iep0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624100133-be7iep0","updated":"20240624102728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：石膏分两种，软石膏跟硬石膏；（软石膏：软石膏作层如压扁米豆糕形，就像年糕一样一层一层的，每层厚数寸，有红白二色，红色不可服，白色洁净细纹，短密如束针，正如凝成白蜡状，松软易烂，烧之即白烂如粉），这是真正的正品石膏；（软石膏）其中明洁色带微青，而文长细如白丝者，名理石也。与软石膏乃一物二种，碎之形色如一，不可辨矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240624101239-6klg5d7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624101239-6klg5d7","updated":"20240624103234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"硬石膏里面又分两种，一种是方解石一种是长石；硬石膏作块而生，直里气棱，如马牙齿尖坚白则段段横解，光亮如云母白石英，在墙壁烧之易散，仍硬不作粉（不容易碎），其似硬石膏成块，击之块块方解，墙壁有光明者，名方解石。方解石烧之，诧散亦不烂，与硬石膏乃一类二种。（方解石就是现在所谓的南寒水石，上文的红石膏常用作北寒水石，但跟神农本草经记载的寒水石不是一个东西）"}]},{"ID":"20240624101944-q9kjc9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624101944-q9kjc9s","updated":"20240624102643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"长石即俗呼硬石膏者，状如软石膏而块不扁，性坚硬洁白，有粗理。起齿棱击之片片横碎，光莹如云母白石英。亦有墙壁，似方解石（跟方解石很相似），但不作方块尔，烧之亦不粉烂而易散，方解石烧之亦然，诧声为异尔（两者烧的时候声音不太一样）。"}]},{"ID":"20240624101047-il1p5q6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624101047-il1p5q6","updated":"20240624101050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：以上图取自药典记载的纤维石膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124634-hgri2jb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611124634-hgri2jb"}},{"ID":"20240611124802-epw4czf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611124802-epw4czf","updated":"20240611124818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理石《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240611124802-zcei2ci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124802-zcei2ci","updated":"20240611124802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛甘，寒、大寒，无毒。主身热，利胃，解烦，益精明目，破积聚，去三虫，除营中去来大热、结热，解烦毒，止消渴及中风痿痹。滑石为之使。恶∶麻黄。生∶汉中山谷及庐山。如石膏顺理而细。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124649-7yod9bi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611124649-7yod9bi"}},{"ID":"20240611124750-qqs0rin","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611124750-qqs0rin","updated":"20240611124754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理石《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240611124750-gnhbjb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124750-gnhbjb8","updated":"20240611124750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如长石，但理石如石膏顺理而细，其非顺理而细者为长石，治疗亦不相辽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124649-fwgz3vq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611124649-fwgz3vq"}},{"ID":"20240611124738-sqskbkg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611124738-sqskbkg","updated":"20240611124742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理石《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240611124738-qvgk0o1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124738-qvgk0o1","updated":"20240611124738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生两石间，皮黄赤，肉白，作斜理文，不似石膏。味辛甘，大寒。无毒。主身热，利胃解烦，除荣卫中去来大热结热。解烦毒，止消渴，及中风痿痹。破积聚，去三虫，益精明目。滑石为之使，恶麻黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124710-nrcrwlq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611124710-nrcrwlq"}},{"ID":"20240611124724-vh9nl4r","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611124724-vh9nl4r","updated":"20240611124731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理石《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611124724-1o06f7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124724-1o06f7v","updated":"20240611124724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、甘，寒、大寒，无毒。主身热，利胃，解烦，益精，明目，破积聚，去三虫，除荣卫中去来大热，结热，解烦毒，止消渴及中风痿痹。一名立制石，一名肌石，如石膏，顺理而细。生汉中山谷及卢山。采无时。（滑石为之使，恶麻黄。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611124724-rb7mdx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124724-rb7mdx0","updated":"20240611124724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶汉中属梁州，卢山属青州，今出宁州。俗用亦稀，《仙经》时须，亦呼为长理石。石胆一名立制，今此又名立制，疑必相乱类。唐本注云∶此石夹两石间如石脉，打用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124724-yyizp6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124724-yyizp6g","updated":"20240611124724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或在土中重叠而生。皮黄赤，肉白，作针理纹，全不似石膏。汉中人取酒渍服之，疗癖，令人肥悦。市人或刮削去皮，以代寒水石，并以当 石，并是假伪。今卢山亦无此物，见出襄州西汛水侧也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124724-1iyqxao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124724-1iyqxao","updated":"20240611124724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经文具长石条下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124724-8wy7wzw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124724-8wy7wzw","updated":"20240611124724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"丹房镜源∶长理石，可食。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124724-ipmx5uh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124724-ipmx5uh","updated":"20240611124724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶理石如长石，但理石如石膏，顺理而细，其非顺理而细者为长石，治疗亦不相辽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124711-koupd23","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611124711-koupd23"}},{"ID":"20240611124712-0fnhljl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611124712-0fnhljl","updated":"20240611124718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理石《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611124712-dapwugy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124712-dapwugy","updated":"20240611124712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、甘，寒、大寒，无毒。主身热，利胃，解烦，益精，明目，破积聚，去三虫。除营卫中去来大热，结热，解烦毒，止消渴，及中风痿痹。一名立制石，一名肌石，如石膏，顺理而细。生汉中山谷及卢山，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124712-o3oa15u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124712-o3oa15u","updated":"20240611124712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石为之使，畏麻黄。汉中属梁州，卢山属青州。今出宁州。俗用亦希，《仙经》时须，亦呼为长理石。石胆一名立制石，今此又名立制，疑必相乱类。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124712-cg09zi6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124712-cg09zi6","updated":"20240611124712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此石夹两石间如石脉，打用之，或在土中重叠而生。皮黄赤，肉白，作针理文，全不似石膏。汉中人取酒浸服，疗癖，令人肥悦。市人或刮去皮，以代寒水石，并以当 石，并是假伪。今卢山亦无此物，见出襄州西泛水侧也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124649-gptp0dq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611124649-gptp0dq"}},{"ID":"20240611124650-cxzdkta","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611124650-cxzdkta","updated":"20240611124653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理石《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611124650-up3k12x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124650-up3k12x","updated":"20240611124650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛甘，寒，大寒，无毒。主身热，利胃解烦，益精明目，破积聚，去三虫，除荣卫中去来大热，结热，解烦毒，止消渴，及中风痿痹。一名立制石，一名肌石。如石膏，顺理而细。生汉中山谷及庐山，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124659-uim9hvw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611124659-uim9hvw"}},{"ID":"20240611124700-6ifksuk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611124700-6ifksuk","updated":"20240611124704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理石《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240611124700-0i417lz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124700-0i417lz","updated":"20240611124700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛寒。主身热。利胃。解烦。益精明目。破积聚。去三虫。一名立制石。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124700-necf7vt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124700-necf7vt","updated":"20240611124700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"横理庚庚。移名立制。脉贯峡封。层分土渍。青缕丝明。赤肤肌腻。迭用柔刚。同归一致。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124700-04fyfpt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124700-04fyfpt","updated":"20240611124700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"史记纪。大横庚庚。逸周书。以移其名。苏恭曰。此石夹两石间如石脉。开用之。或在土中重叠而生。皮正赤肉白。名医曰。一名肌石。李时珍曰。石肤有软硬二种。理石顺理而微。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124700-iup9w52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124700-iup9w52","updated":"20240611124700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"硬者长纹细直如丝而明洁。色带微青。与软石膏一类通用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124634-2k1iqos","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611124634-2k1iqos"}},{"ID":"20240611124635-e7ug4g1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-e7ug4g1","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：理石"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-z6gk23i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-z6gk23i","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-8qs85ui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-8qs85ui","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Lǐ Shí"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-gz1y5bh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-gz1y5bh","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-ua1y9rl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-ua1y9rl","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 立制石（《本经》），肌石（《别录》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-wfs7mpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-wfs7mpm","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-leskxj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-leskxj0","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-m351bvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-m351bvu","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-o4hf01z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-o4hf01z","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为硫酸盐类矿物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"石膏"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"纤维石膏"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-ougmq6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-ougmq6a","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-4r9w6sm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-4r9w6sm","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 纤维石膏:为白色纤维状，或针状，而具有绢丝光泽之块，微透明，参见\"石膏\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-j5jd9ri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-j5jd9ri","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-2r7mx8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-2r7mx8y","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛甘，寐。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-7xgq458","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-7xgq458","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味辛，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-5cjuzmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-5cjuzmx","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"甘，大寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-yy2lobp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-yy2lobp","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-dufv66v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-dufv66v","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经集注》：\"滑石为主使，恶麻黄。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-6l6s7rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-6l6s7rw","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-cxs40qf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-cxs40qf","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热，除烦，止渴。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-v2lqp36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-v2lqp36","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主身热，利胃解烦，益精明目，破积聚，去三虫。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-caw7blf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-caw7blf","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"除营卫中去来大热、结热，解烦毒，止消渴，及中风痿痹。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-dvxd721","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-dvxd721","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《唐本草》：\"酒溃服之，疗癖，令人肥悦。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-r8c36cu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-r8c36cu","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-kk7qig9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-kk7qig9","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-9ifbuz9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-9ifbuz9","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》：理石"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-8ofybpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-8ofybpn","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-v55j3tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-v55j3tr","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Lǐ Shí"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-i1bz3y5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-i1bz3y5","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-ndtm7vn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-ndtm7vn","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 立制石、肌石、长理石、肥石、不灰木"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-konyavw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-konyavw","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-d8thcd3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-d8thcd3","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Fibrous gypsum"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-moapx2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-moapx2t","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-nbjojmj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-nbjojmj","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-v2y2uhj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-v2y2uhj","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草衍义》：理石如长石，但理石如石膏顺理而细，其非顺理而细看为长石，治疗亦不相辽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-cl6vo7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-cl6vo7x","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：理石，即石膏中之长文细直如丝而明洁色带微青者。唐人谓石膏为寒水石，长石为石膏，故苏恭言其不似石膏也。此石与软石膏一类二色，亦可通用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-72hf34q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-72hf34q","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-5a8ncc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-5a8ncc4","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为硫酸盐类石膏族矿物石膏[Ca(SO4)·2H2O]与硬石膏[Ca(SO4)]的集合体。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-cg7k2mm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-cg7k2mm","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Gypsum and Anhydrite"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-pt3lgwi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-pt3lgwi","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-x7zk5ue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-x7zk5ue","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：形成于各种类型石膏层的裂隙或硬石膏层水化部位。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-i5hdi76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-i5hdi76","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：山西、陕西、湖北等地均有此资源。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-7bhiilx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-7bhiilx","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-rm6weev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-rm6weev","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 单斜晶系。属个体纤维状、集合体细脉状或透镜状的石膏变种。新鲜面白色，风化面灰、黄、褐黄等色，或被粘土质围岩污染，呈青灰等色调。条痕白色。新鲜断面丝绢光泽，或见解理面的反光亮点；风化面黯淡，无光泽。肉眼见不到解理面，只见平行纤维方向的解理纹和(或)斜交纤维的解理纹。断口 不平坦至参差状。硬度2(脱水—硬石膏化则硬度增大)，性脆，易碎。相对密度2.3(或随硬石膏化增大密度)。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-2tnrxg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-2tnrxg4","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-b8z8whz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-b8z8whz","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 本品为不规则块状。深灰色。体较轻，质硬脆，可砸碎，断面大部分粗糙，呈暗灰色，解理面可见到明显亮星；其中部分可见到直立的细纤维，纤维间亦可见到亮星。气、味皆淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-kcsa0jl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-kcsa0jl","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 (1)石膏 参见“石膏”条。(2)硬石膏 参见“长石”条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-xj5ptyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-xj5ptyw","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-67j0e4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-67j0e4j","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (1)石膏 参见“石膏”条。(2)硬石膏 参见“长石”条。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-tqpw57c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-tqpw57c","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"X射线衍射分析曲线：7.68(\u003e10),4.31(5),3.82(10),3.08(6),2.88(2),2.80(1),2.70(2),2.61(1),2.54(1),2.51(1),2.46(1),2.22(2),由此表明理石主要组成矿物为石膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-rb8hm3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-rb8hm3k","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"差热分析曲线：吸热175℃(大)，205℃(大)；放热375℃(微)；由125℃始230℃止失重；表明属石膏的特征；但不同于纯石膏曲线。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-8bmn2vt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-8bmn2vt","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-fvffgpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-fvffgpf","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-zokfrt8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-zokfrt8","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-nuyhxeg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-nuyhxeg","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛甘；寒；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-7ts4jyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-7ts4jyp","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-4326yob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-4326yob","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经集注》：滑石为之使，恶麻黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-skji1is","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-skji1is","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-16ezrud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-16ezrud","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热除烦；养胃益阴；益清明目；消积破聚。主身热心烦；痿痹；消渴"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-4fg4v88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-4fg4v88","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-65h96s9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-65h96s9","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，15-30g。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-m2y8x09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-m2y8x09","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-7b1g2yb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-7b1g2yb","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主身热，利胃解烦，益精明目，破积聚，去三虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-akms2pk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-akms2pk","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：除营卫中去来大热、结热，解烦毒，止消渴，及中风痿痹。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-scmba9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-scmba9h","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《唐本草》：酒渍服之，疗癖，令人肥悦。"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-ohflg45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-ohflg45","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611124635-mzh39ux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124635-mzh39ux","updated":"20240611124635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611124637-7kxvjoo","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611124637-7kxvjoo"}},{"ID":"20240611124638-wrabyi2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611124638-wrabyi2"}}]}